---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY MAPPING (web → native)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  data:   ChargingSession slice {charger_type, peak_power_w(W), total_energy_added_wh(Wh),
            started_at, ended_at}                       → ChargingSessionInput (Models, SI)
  group:  getChargerLabel(s) (Tesla→Supercharger; other charger_type→DC Fast;
            peak>20kW→DC Fast; else Home / AC)          → ChargerTypeProjection.classify
  stats:  chargerTypeStats useMemo (Map insertion order; count, avgKw=peak_power_w/1000,
            avgKwh=total_energy_added_wh/1000, avgDuration=durationMinutes) → ChargerTypeProjection.points
  shell:  <ChartContainer title subtitle ariaLabel>     → TSFadeIn + tokenized glass card
            (Color.TS.surface + TSRadius.lg + Color.TS.border), header + subtitle
  chart:  Recharts ComposedChart, <Bar avgKw> (left kW axis) + <Bar avgKwh opacity 0.6>
            (right kWh axis), per-charger <Cell> fills   → Swift Charts Chart{ BarMark }
            clustered by metric via .position(by:), .foregroundStyle = adaptive charger
            token (energy at 0.6 opacity). The web dual y-axes collapse to one Swift
            Charts y-domain (single scale per Chart); the two units are disambiguated by
            the metric legend, the tooltip ("X kW" / "Y kWh"), and the data table.
  colors: CHARGER_COLORS intent supercharger #ef4444 / dc #f59e0b / home #10b981
            → statusDanger / statusWarning / statusSuccess adaptive tokens (the web map
            only keys "Supercharger"; the obvious per-charger intent from its internal
            supercharger/dc/home keys is reproduced — each charger its own hue).
  tip:    <Tooltip content={<ChartTooltip/>}> (Avg Power / Avg Energy)
            → ChargerTypeTooltip via .chartXSelection RuleMark annotation
  legend: per-charger bottom list `{count} sessions · {avgDuration} min avg`
            → ChargerTypeBreakdownRows (color swatch + localized name + same text)
  table:  ChartContainer data + dataColumns (Charger Type / Sessions / Avg kW / Avg kWh /
            Avg minutes) accessible fallback           → ChargerTypeDataTable (Grid)
  i18n:   every t(key,default) from source resolved through ChargerTypeStrings facade
            (table "ChargerTypeChart"); charger display names localized (fallbacks
            identical to the web getChargerLabel strings) so no English literal ships.

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface):
  loading  → ChargerTypeLoadingChart (TSSkeleton bars; reduce-motion safe)
  content  → ChargerTypeBarChart + metric legend + breakdown rows + data table
  empty    → ChargerTypeEmpty (ContentUnavailableView, web common.noData) — never blank
  error    → ChargerTypeError (QueryError-equiv, Retry → model.refresh())
  stale    → freshness chip (Stale) + connectivity banner + one guarded auto-refresh
  offline  → freshness chip (Offline) + banner; keeps cached columns, no refetch
a11y: container summary (title + charger-type count + total sessions), per-charger
  VoiceOver value carrying all 5 column figures (Sessions / Avg kW / Avg kWh / Avg
  minutes), reduce-motion animation gate, Dynamic Type via system fonts/tokens.
telemetry: P1/S11 view.opened(surface:"ChargerTypeChart") emitted once on appear.

